 # Settings for the Log4j Appender instrumentation

-| System property                                                                    | Type    | Default | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
-| ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
-| `otel.instrumentation.common.logging.structured-attributes.included`               | String  |         | Comma-separated list of case-sensitive glob patterns for event-local structured log attribute keys to capture. Applies to Log4j `MapMessage` entries, SLF4J key-value pairs, Logback Logstash markers, and Logstash structured arguments. `*` matches any number of characters and `?` matches one character. Excluded patterns take precedence. An exclude-only selector captures every key not excluded. Under v3-preview, an absent or empty selector captures all structured attributes by default. MDC and logger-context attributes remain separate and opt-in.                                                                                                          |
-| `otel.instrumentation.common.logging.structured-attributes.excluded`               | String  |         | Comma-separated list of case-sensitive glob patterns for event-local structured log attribute keys not to capture. Applies to Log4j `MapMessage` entries, SLF4J key-value pairs, Logback Logstash markers, and Logstash structured arguments. Excluded patterns take precedence over included patterns. An exclude-only selector captures every key not excluded; `*` captures no structured attributes. This does not affect `otel.event.name`, MDC, or logger context.                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
